# Resurrected Cultist's delirium ability (CR 207.2c, 602.5b, 400.7, 122.6). On turn 1 Bot1 plays an Island, then Black Lotus, Mox Jet
# and Mox Ruby pay for a Wheel of Fortune ({2}{R}); the Wheel discards the Cultist and a Memnite: the graveyard holds a creature, an
# artifact and a sorcery (Memnite is both creature and artifact, the Lotus is an artifact): three types. On turn 3, with {2}{B}{B}
# available (Mox Jet, Mox Ruby, Island, Swamp), the ability is refused. On turn 5 a Lightning Bolt to Bot2's face (Mox Ruby) adds an
# instant, the fourth type, and now, with three sources left, it is still refused (it costs four mana); after the land drop Mox Jet, Island and two Swamps pay {2}{B}{B} and the Cultist returns untapped (a 4/1) with a finality
# counter, no longer in the graveyard.

